            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Thanks for the response.\r\n\r\n> [Examining the state of cases](https://github.com/nvim-neorocks/busted-interop-examples/blob/d7daad8a564da7eea444dfd6a640db6508d18e5b/mini.test/spec/mini_tests_spec.lua#L15-L1) is the suggested way to extract any information about how tests were executed.\r\n\r\nThis is what I had tried, initially, but I was trying to use `MiniTest.current.all_cases`, which didn't seem to work.\r\nThanks for the recommendation. That works too.\r\n\r\n> Does this clarify the situation?\r\n\r\nYes. Closing :smile: \r\n",
